  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical Assistance for Revenue Administration and Revenue Policy - Guatemala</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Funded by the MCC as a component of a threshold program, OTA Revenues assistance to the Superintendencia de Administracin Tributaria (SAT) is focused on increasing revenue mobilization by improving the audit, customs, and information technology (IT) functions. Project work in tax administration ended in April 2018, which strengthened the audit quality process in the large and medium taxpayer office to reduce the number of audit adjustments dismissed in the courts. Current project work on customs administration focuses on increasing revenue collection through effective risk management and the use of a robust post clearance audit program; and, strengthening results of examinations by improving port security, and implementing effective valuation databases.</narrative>
  </description>
